{
  "$schema": "../schema/component.schema.json",
  "id": "sparkles",
  "title": "闪烁粒子",
  "description": "用于渲染可配置密度、大小与颜色的闪烁粒子背景层组件。",
  "category": "effect",
  "tags": [
    "canvas",
    "particles",
    "aceternity-ui"
  ],
  "platforms": [
    "web"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "background",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "画布背景色；作为叠加层使用时通常显式设为 `\"transparent\"`。",
      "default": "\"#0d47a1\""
    },
    {
      "name": "particleColor",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "粒子颜色，需为 6 位十六进制值（内部会拼接透明度通道）。",
      "default": "\"#ffffff\""
    },
    {
      "name": "minSize",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "粒子最小半径（px）。",
      "default": "1"
    },
    {
      "name": "maxSize",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "粒子最大半径（px）。",
      "default": "3"
    },
    {
      "name": "speed",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "粒子漂移速度倍率。",
      "default": "4"
    },
    {
      "name": "particleDensity",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "粒子数量；密集星光效果常用 800-1200。",
      "default": "120"
    }
  ],
  "events": [],
  "slots": [],
  "exposes": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "path": "app/components/reborn/examples/sparkles/SparklesDemo.vue",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    },
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "path": "app/components/reborn/examples/sparkles/SparklesFullPageDemo.vue",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "标题背后或下方铺设星光粒子的装饰背景。",
    "需要随明暗模式切换 particleColor 的粒子层（示例配合 useColorMode）。",
    "全屏或局部区域需要粒子氛围背景时。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "只给一段文字加闪光点缀，改用 sparkles-text。",
    "需要流星雨划过动画，改用 meteors。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用。",
    "无插槽与事件，前景内容需自行绝对定位叠放在其上。",
    "background 默认为 #0d47a1，做叠加层时通常需显式设为 transparent。",
    "particleDensity 默认 120，示例中密集效果用到 800-1200。"
  ],
  "dependencies": [
    "@vueuse/core"
  ],
  "install": {
    "cli": "npx reborn-ui@latest add sparkles"
  },
  "sourceRefs": {
